§ 50.76 Swaps entered into by inter -
national financial institutions.
(a) Swaps entered into by an inter -
national financial institution shall be
exempt from the clearing requirement
of section 2(h)(1)(A) of the Act.
(b) For purposes of this section, the
term international financial institution
means:
(1) African Development Bank;
(2) African Development Fund;
(3) Asian Development Bank;
(4) Banco Centroamericano de
